//! ORIGIN NOTICE: this file is a conversion, made with the assistance of a language model and checked by a person, of
//! logic that already existed in the earlier tools Zartex and Zartex 2 (the Zartex 2 Lua mission script class and its compiler).
//! The logic is not original to this repository. What this repository adjusted, added or corrected in it:
//! - generated by tools_gen_api.py from NodeTypes.cs, then reviewed
//!
//! Names of the logic node types and of the actor node types, looked up by their numeric id.
//! Used by readable.rs and luaraw.rs in zartex-core, and by model.rs and creator_tools.rs in zartex-app.
//!
//! This file is generated by tools_gen_api.py (function gen_nodenames). It reads the three dictionaries of
//! Zartex 2's Logic\NodeTypes.cs (LogicNodeTypes, LogicNodeTypesDPL and ActorNodeTypes) and writes one
//! `(id, name)` pair per entry, in the order of the source, with the ids and names unchanged. The entries of
//! LOGIC_NODE_TYPES_DPL are not sorted by id. The comment lines in this file were added after generation and are
//! lost when the generator runs again.
